INSERT OR IGNORE INTO question_content_sections (id,question_id,section_type,body,provenance,publication_state,answer_leak_state,reviewed_by,reviewed_at,position) SELECT 'bulk-2026-1085-summary','bulk-2026-1085','SUMMARY','This question examines creative thought through the changing evidence and vocabulary of psychology & mind. It traces how methods, institutions, and perspectives have reframed the inquiry, identifies connections with neighbouring questions, and preserves the uncertainties that remain without presenting a proposed answer.','EDITORIAL','PUBLISHED','PASSED','EDITORIAL','2026-08-11',0 WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM questions WHERE id='bulk-2026-1085');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO question_content_sections (id,question_id,section_type,body,provenance,publication_state,answer_leak_state,reviewed_by,reviewed_at,position) SELECT 'bulk-2026-1085-origins','bulk-2026-1085','ORIGINS','Questions about creative thought first took shape through practical experience, inherited knowledge, and attempts to compare recurring patterns. The present formulation belongs to a later vocabulary: archives, institutions, and specialized methods gradually separated concerns that earlier communities often treated together, while leaving important continuities open to interpretation.','EDITORIAL','PUBLISHED','PASSED','EDITORIAL','2026-08-11',1 WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM questions WHERE id='bulk-2026-1085');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO question_content_sections (id,question_id,section_type,body,provenance,publication_state,answer_leak_state,reviewed_by,reviewed_at,position) SELECT 'bulk-2026-1085-evolution','bulk-2026-1085','EVOLUTION','The inquiry developed as researchers gained new records, instruments, conceptual distinctions, and opportunities for comparison. Each shift made some aspects of creative thought more visible while changing the scale of analysis and the standards applied to evidence. Competing fields still organize the problem differently rather than sharing one final formulation.','EDITORIAL','PUBLISHED','PASSED','EDITORIAL','2026-08-11',2 WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM questions WHERE id='bulk-2026-1085');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO question_content_sections (id,question_id,section_type,body,provenance,publication_state,answer_leak_state,reviewed_by,reviewed_at,position) SELECT 'bulk-2026-1085-why_asked','bulk-2026-1085','WHY_ASKED','People keep asking about creative thought when established categories no longer fit observations, when new capabilities expose an old uncertainty, or when institutions must act before evidence is complete. The question therefore moves between specialist research and public experience, gathering different priorities as it crosses communities and historical settings.','EDITORIAL','PUBLISHED','PASSED','EDITORIAL','2026-08-11',3 WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM questions WHERE id='bulk-2026-1085');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO question_content_sections (id,question_id,section_type,body,provenance,publication_state,answer_leak_state,reviewed_by,reviewed_at,position) SELECT 'bulk-2026-1085-why_it_matters','bulk-2026-1085','WHY_IT_MATTERS','How creative thought is framed influences research priorities, education, professional practice, and public choices. Definitions determine what gets measured, whose experience becomes visible, and which consequences receive attention. Following those choices helps distinguish the history of the inquiry from any particular claim offered in response to it.','EDITORIAL','PUBLISHED','PASSED','EDITORIAL','2026-08-11',4 WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM questions WHERE id='bulk-2026-1085');
